    "directions": [
      "Combine 10 oz&#32;granulated sugar and 8 oz&#32;water in a small saucepan and stir over medium heat until the sugar is dissolved.",
      "Zest and juice the limes. Add all the zest, 6 oz&#32;lime juice and 2 ½ oz&#32;cachaça to the syrup and allow it to cool to room temperature",
      "Refrigerate until the mix is very cold, at least 3-4 hours or overnight",
      "Run in your ice cream machine according to the manufacturer&#39;s directions. (See Note)",
      "Pack into a plastic container, cover the surface with plastic wrap, cover and freeze overnight"
